  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\"] [:db/add \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/value \"0\"] [:db/ensure \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\"] [:db/add \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/value \"-2\"] [:db/ensure \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/id #uuid \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\"] [:db/add \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/value \"1\"] [:db/ensure \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/id #uuid \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [:db/add \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/value \"-1\"] [:db/ensure \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/id #uuid \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\"] [:db/add \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\"] [:db/add \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/correct \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [:db/ensure \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/id #uuid \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\"] [:db/add \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [:db/add \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(-1\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n-1.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/answer-fields \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\"] [:db/ensure \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\"] [:db/add \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/id #uuid \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\"] [:db/add \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/id #uuid \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [:db/add \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/id #uuid \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\"] [:db/add \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\"] [:db/add \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/id #uuid \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\"] [:db/add \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/value \"0\"] [:db/ensure \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\"] [:db/add \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/correct \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [:db/ensure \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/id #uuid \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\"] [:db/add \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [:db/add \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/answer-fields \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\"] [:db/ensure \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\"] [:db/add \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/id #uuid \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [:db/add \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/id #uuid \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\"] [:db/add \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/id #uuid \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\"] [:db/add \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/id #uuid \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\"] [:db/add \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{9}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\"] [:db/add \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\"] [:db/add \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/correct \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [:db/ensure \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/id #uuid \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\"] [:db/add \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/answer-fields \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\"] [:db/ensure \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\"] [:db/add \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/id #uuid \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\"] [:db/add \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/value \"2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/id #uuid \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\"] [:db/add \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [:db/add \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/id #uuid \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\"] [:db/add \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/id #uuid \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\"] [:db/add \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\"] [:db/add \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/correct \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [:db/ensure \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/id #uuid \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\"] [:db/add \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/answer-fields \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\"] [:db/ensure \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\"] [:db/add \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/id #uuid \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\"] [:db/add \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/id #uuid \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\"] [:db/add \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{6}\"] [:db/ensure \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/id #uuid \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\"] [:db/add \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/id #uuid \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [:db/add \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/id #uuid \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\"] [:db/add \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\"] [:db/add \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/correct \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [:db/ensure \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/id #uuid \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\"] [:db/add \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [:db/add \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/answer-fields \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\"] [:db/ensure \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\"] [:db/add \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/id #uuid \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\"] [:db/add \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{9}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/id #uuid \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\"] [:db/add \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{5}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\"] [:db/add \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/id #uuid \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\"] [:db/add \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\"] [:db/ensure \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/id #uuid \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [:db/add \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [:db/add \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/correct \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [:db/ensure \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/id #uuid \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\"] [:db/add \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [:db/add \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\pi&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{3}{2}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/answer-fields \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\"] [:db/ensure \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\"] [:db/add \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/id #uuid \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\"] [:db/add \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/id #uuid \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [:db/add \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/id #uuid \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\"] [:db/add \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/value \"4 x+C\"] [:db/ensure \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/id #uuid \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\"] [:db/add \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/id #uuid \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\"] [:db/add \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/value \"\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\"] [:db/add \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/correct \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [:db/ensure \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/id #uuid \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\"] [:db/add \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/answer-fields \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\"] [:db/ensure \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\"] [:db/add \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/id #uuid \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\"] [:db/add \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/value \"3 x+C\"] [:db/ensure \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/id #uuid \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\"] [:db/add \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{6}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/id #uuid \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [:db/add \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/id #uuid \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\"] [:db/add \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\"] [:db/add \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\"] [:db/add \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/correct \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [:db/ensure \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/id #uuid \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\"] [:db/add \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/answer-fields \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\"] [:db/ensure \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"30ce02a5-409b-536f-b557-7858bf117619\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/38/38a326c04d5fcb33a04795da5cbbd2eabbe393c4ab55bf0e946500a42e4beaca/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\"] [\"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\" :answer/value \"0\"] [\"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\"] [\"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\" :answer/value \"-2\"] [\"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/id #uuid \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\"] [\"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\" :answer/value \"1\"] [\"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/id #uuid \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [\"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\" :answer/value \"-1\"] [\"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/id #uuid \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\"] [\"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"cc61cae7-6338-530b-9138-1d0cb66768ee\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/choices \"63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67\"] [\"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\" :answer-field/correct \"be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f\"] [\"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/id #uuid \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\"] [\"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [\"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(-1\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n-1.\\n$$\"] [\"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\" :question/answer-fields \"36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf\"] [\"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/id #uuid \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\"] [\"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\"] [\"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/id #uuid \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [\"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [\"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/id #uuid \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\"] [\"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\"] [\"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\"] [\"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5}{3}\"] [\"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/id #uuid \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\"] [\"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\" :answer/value \"0\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/choices \"99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5\"] [\"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\" :answer-field/correct \"c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9\"] [\"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/id #uuid \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\"] [\"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [\"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\" :question/answer-fields \"37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"faa2cd78-ea47-5dd0-a920-89ce06af0eb4\"] [\"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/id #uuid \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [\"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/id #uuid \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\"] [\"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/id #uuid \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\"] [\"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/id #uuid \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\"] [\"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{9}+C\"] [\"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\"] [\"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"ad4f3ee3-3ab8-500f-aace-22010201a5c6\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"bdae9815-2795-5762-afa6-e76435e009c8\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"3f8d42b1-f703-53bf-8f19-1376ee424ff7\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/choices \"1e8cb45a-8796-558a-b4d0-e864913116b4\"] [\"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\" :answer-field/correct \"4b61a539-a800-5d5f-a30b-06695677f4e6\"] [\"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/id #uuid \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\"] [\"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\" :question/answer-fields \"9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5\"] [\"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/id #uuid \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\"] [\"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\" :answer/value \"2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/id #uuid \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\"] [\"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [\"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/id #uuid \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\"] [\"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/id #uuid \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\"] [\"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/choices \"4a1b4f5c-3fbd-5139-abde-77a228bc5240\"] [\"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\" :answer-field/correct \"fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e\"] [\"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/id #uuid \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\"] [\"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\" :question/answer-fields \"dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08\"] [\"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/id #uuid \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\"] [\"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [\"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/id #uuid \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\"] [\"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{6}\"] [\"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/id #uuid \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\"] [\"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5}{3}\"] [\"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/id #uuid \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [\"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [\"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/id #uuid \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\"] [\"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/choices \"c8881746-be52-5dcd-8b63-58033a971a4d\"] [\"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\" :answer-field/correct \"d453fbd2-1f3d-5451-92b4-6c4db0262063\"] [\"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/id #uuid \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\"] [\"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [\"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\" :question/answer-fields \"1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230\"] [\"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/id #uuid \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\"] [\"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{9}{2}\"] [\"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/id #uuid \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\"] [\"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{5}{2}\"] [\"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\"] [\"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\"] [\"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/id #uuid \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\"] [\"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\"] [\"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/id #uuid \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [\"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"9c8527fb-e71b-5fad-b3a3-b5c7bf37f1e9\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"18ec2bea-206e-5b06-951d-4e2280e5edb6\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/choices \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [\"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\" :answer-field/correct \"b9ea0365-cb88-50d2-b0c4-888fa040b575\"] [\"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/id #uuid \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\"] [\"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the exact value.\"] [\"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\pi&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{3}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\" :question/answer-fields \"c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92\"] [\"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/id #uuid \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\"] [\"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [\"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/id #uuid \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [\"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [\"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/id #uuid \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\"] [\"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\" :answer/value \"4 x+C\"] [\"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/id #uuid \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\"] [\"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\"] [\"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/id #uuid \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\"] [\"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\" :answer/value \"\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"623b8d6d-4c6a-5ae6-aeb6-d6e4483b3b1a\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"d13fd4d1-429c-5e55-a934-b706e8e4b633\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/choices \"6614375c-3c55-530b-aefa-f62d35b1e55d\"] [\"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\" :answer-field/correct \"562a3564-6ffa-53bd-83ad-234ebaf6f7d6\"] [\"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/id #uuid \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\"] [\"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\" :question/answer-fields \"610c8b82-d29e-5956-aa7b-e2be2ccb4624\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"0b826ead-2d5f-50fb-b094-ec1c658efcc8\"] [\"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/id #uuid \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\"] [\"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\" :answer/value \"3 x+C\"] [\"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/id #uuid \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\"] [\"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{6}+C\"] [\"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/id #uuid \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [\"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/id #uuid \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\"] [\"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\"] [\"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{3}+C\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"aa1a2769-faaa-5638-961a-509c01537a31\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"2e97c4a2-cec7-50a6-85f0-0bde138ee683\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"0c64ab8a-a63f-524c-8e5e-8c71a216c690\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/choices \"6b6f0ffa-6cb8-52a4-bb8e-3c836cceb250\"] [\"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\" :answer-field/correct \"e9ffe8b5-8eec-5bb2-9b9d-c5977e364435\"] [\"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/id #uuid \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\"] [\"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\" :question/answer-fields \"818d2c32-33ff-59d7-a53b-7643f13ae8b7\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"64b6e5b5-1df5-520e-82de-d885b5a5ff4c\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"30ce02a5-409b-536f-b557-7858bf117619\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/38/38a326c04d5fcb33a04795da5cbbd2eabbe393c4ab55bf0e946500a42e4beaca/generator.py\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"]] \"retractions\" [[17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator 17592186682522]]}",
