  "before_edn": "{:db/id 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id 17592186068567 :question/id #uuid \"0021ae6a-8ef8-564e-9c2e-fb5f9e8f7313\" :question/math-academy-id \"e-464\" :question/problem \"Calculate the integral $$\\n\\\\displaystyle\\\\int 2 \\\\sin {\\\\left(\\\\dfrac x 3\\\\right)} \\\\,  \\\\textrm{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"If we let $u=\\\\dfrac x 3,$ then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\dfrac{\\\\textrm d u}{\\\\textrm d x} = \\\\dfrac 1 3\\\\quad\\\\Longrightarrow\\\\quad \\\\textrm d x =3\\\\, \\\\textrm d u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int 2\\\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =2\\\\int \\\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\\\cdot 3\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\cdot 3\\\\int \\\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =-6\\\\operatorname{cos}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =-6\\\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid \"746d1bc6-98ec-59a1-bec6-9dcfb7081a5d\" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id 17592186048332 :topic/difficulty 1.7335518935867262 :topic/encompasses [{:db/id 17592186428117 :encompassing/rationale \"Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account foundations: 1 rises / 2 eligible passed source activities = 0.500000; nearest selected fraction = 1/2. Crossing activity numbers [2]; waits [2]. Separate account estimates: foundations=1/2 (1/2). Selection: most observations, then lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: True. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does not interpret color steps as physical repetition units. Method: encompassing-report.md. Evidence: reference/mathacademy/encompassing-analysis-2026-10-11/frequency-fractions/foundations-frequency-estimate